<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>正中大健康集团 | 全球领先的中医药现代化产业引领者</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/tcm/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.loli.net/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #8C1C13;
            --secondary: #A67C52;
            --accent: #D4AF37;
            --text: #2C2C2C;
            --light: #F9F7F2;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --dark: #121212;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            --transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            background-color: var(--light);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1,
        h2,
        h3,
        h4,
        .serif {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* --- Scroll Animations --- */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(15px); /* Reduced from 30px for smoother transition */
            transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
        }

        section {
            padding: 100px 0; /* Standardized from 140px to reduce blank gaps */
        }

        .reveal.active {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* --- Marquee --- */
        .marquee-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .marquee-content {
            display: flex;
            width: fit-content;
            animation: marquee 20s linear infinite;
        }

        .marquee-content div {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 0 40px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ccc;
            white-space: nowrap;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .marquee-content div:hover {
            filter: grayscale(0%);
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        @keyframes marquee {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
        }

        /* --- Timeline --- */
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 0;
        }

        .timeline::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 2px;
            background: var(--accent);
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -1px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            padding: 20px 40px;
            position: relative;
            background: inherit;
            width: 50%;
        }

        .timeline-item.left { left: 0; }
        .timeline-item.right { left: 50%; }

        .timeline-item::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            right: -10px;
            background-color: white;
            border: 4px solid var(--primary);
            top: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .timeline-item.right::after {
            left: -10px;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            padding: 20px 30px;
            background: white;
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* --- Header --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 25px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        header.scrolled {
            background: var(--glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 15px 5%;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 26px;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* --- Hero --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--dark);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: url('assets/img/zhengzhong_hero_bg_1.png');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            opacity: 0.6;
            transform: scale(1.1);
            animation: kenBurns 20s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes kenBurns {
            from {
                transform: scale(1.1);
            }

            to {
                transform: scale(1.2);
            }
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 1000px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 82px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            text-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        /* --- Sections --- */
        section {
            padding: 100px 5%;
        }

        section.hero {
            padding: 0;
        }

        .section-tag {
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            color: var(--primary);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        /* --- Info Cards --- */
        .card-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .info-card {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: var(--transition);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .info-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-20px);
            box-shadow: 0 40px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .info-card i {
            font-size: 54px;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* --- Global Map Section --- */
        .global-vision {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* --- Digital Museum --- */
        .museum-section {
            background: var(--white);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 80px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .museum-visual {
            border-radius: 40px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .museum-visual img {
            width: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        /* --- Product Gallery --- */
        .product-hero {
            background: var(--light);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .product-gallery {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .product-main {
            flex: 2;
            border-radius: 40px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .product-main img {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .product-details {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .p-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Footer --- */
        footer {
            background: #080808;
            color: #888;
            padding: 100px 10% 40px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: var(--white);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: block;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {

            .card-grid,
            .museum-section,
            .product-gallery {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 52px;
            }
        }

        /* --- Premium Custom Scrollbar --- */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: var(--light);
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--secondary), var(--accent));
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
        }

        /* --- Global Easing --- */
        .smooth-transition {
            transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        /* --- Glassmorphism Card System --- */
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border-radius: 24px;
            transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        .glass-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-12px) scale(1.02);
            border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(140, 28, 19, 0.1);
        }

        /* --- 3D Tilting Cards --- */
        .tilt-card-wrapper {
            perspective: 1000px;
        }
        .tilt-card {
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        /* --- 352 Dashboard Styles --- */
        .dashboard-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        .stat-ring-box {
            position: relative;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .stat-svg {
            transform: rotate(-90deg);
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .stat-circle-bg {
            fill: none;
            stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            stroke-width: 10;
        }
        .stat-circle-val {
            fill: none;
            stroke: url(#goldGradient);
            stroke-width: 10;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            stroke-dasharray: 440;
            stroke-dashoffset: 440;
            transition: stroke-dashoffset 2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        .stat-number {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.5);
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
        }
        .stat-number span {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-left: 2px;
        }
        .stat-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        /* --- Smart Bezel control panel --- */
        .bezel-panel {
            border: 10px solid #1a1a1d;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #020205;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 30px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .bezel-header {
            background: #111115;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #222;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            color: #888;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .bezel-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #00ff66;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 8px;
            animation: pulse-green 1.5s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-green {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.7); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0, 255, 102, 0); }
        }

        /* --- Traceability Modal Popup --- */
        .trace-modal {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            z-index: 10000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        .trace-modal.active {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }
        .trace-content {
            background: rgba(20, 20, 25, 0.95);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            border-radius: 30px;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 700px;
            padding: 40px;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
            transform: scale(0.9);
            transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            max-height: 85vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            position: relative;
        }
        .trace-modal.active .trace-content {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
        .trace-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 25px;
            right: 25px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 24px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        .trace-close:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* --- Trace Timeline --- */
        .trace-timeline {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }
        .trace-timeline::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 2px;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            top: 5px;
            bottom: 5px;
            left: 5px;
        }
        .trace-node {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .trace-node::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            left: -29px;
            top: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent);
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .trace-node-time {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .trace-node-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .trace-node-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #aaa;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* --- Micro-animations --- */
        @keyframes scroll-breath {
            0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.3; }
            50% { transform: translateY(10px); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.3; }
        }
        .scroll-indicator {
            animation: scroll-breath 2s infinite;
        }
        
        .pill-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #b32a22);
            color: white;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(140, 28, 19, 0.2);
        }
    </style>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/titan-core.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header id="header">
        <a href="#" class="logo serif">
            <img src="assets/img/zhengzhong-assets/臻博园logo.png" alt="臻博园" style="height: 52px; background:white; padding:2px; border-radius:4px;">
            <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; margin-left:12px;">
                <span style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; font-weight:700;">臻博园</span>
                <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--accent);">正中生活 | 臻博园 · 正中灵芝庄园</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">集团内核</a>
            <a href="#preparations">特色制剂</a>
            <a href="#vision">全球愿景</a>
            <a href="#products">臻萃系列</a>
            <a href="#digital-rural">数字乡村</a>
            <a href="#social">未来使命</a>
        </nav>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:20px;">
            <button class="btn-premium" style="padding:10px 25px; font-size:13px;">联系我们</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Dynamic Hero -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-bg"></div>
            <div class="hero-content reveal">
                <span class="section-tag" style="color:var(--accent); text-shadow:none;">INTEGRITY & BALANCE</span>
                <h1 class="serif" style="text-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); font-size: 72px; line-height: 1.2; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 30%, var(--accent) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">正本清源<br>中道养生</h1>
                <p style="font-size:20px; letter-spacing:3px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px;">跨越千年的草本智慧，连接未来的科技文明</p>
                <div style="margin-top:50px; display:flex; gap:20px; justify-content:center;">
                    <i class="fas fa-play-circle" style="font-size:60px; opacity:0.6; cursor:pointer;"></i>
                    <span style="align-self:center; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px;">观看集团宣传片</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 10; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.6;">向下探索</span>
                <div class="scroll-indicator" style="width: 24px; height: 36px; border: 2px solid white; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding-top: 6px;">
                    <div style="width: 4px; height: 8px; background: white; border-radius: 2px;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Core Philosophy: 三好与三特色 -->
        <section id="about" class="reveal" style="padding: 100px 5%; background: var(--light);">
            <div class="container">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">
                    <span class="section-tag" style="color:var(--secondary);">Core Philosophy</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">“三好·三特色”高质量发展核心基盘</h2>
                    <p style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; color: #666; font-size: 18px;">
                        以灵芝全产业链为核心引擎，深度融入四川省川产道地药材全产业链质量标准提升示范工程（“352 工程”），锻造高质量大健康核心资产。
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 三好板块 -->
                <h3 class="serif" style="font-size: 28px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--primary);"><span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: 8px;">三好 · 产业底盘</span></h3>
                <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px;">
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-campground" style="color: var(--primary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">好场景</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">打造“灵芝庄园 + 种植基地 + 灵芝谷 + 体验中心”四大沉浸式微度假目的地。依托近千亩种植基地，形成自然奇观，并提供集科普、文创、膳食、主题住宿及产品展销于一体的微循环体验系统。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-stethoscope" style="color: var(--primary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">好医疗</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">锚定“名医+精准干预”的中医高地。特邀国医名医定期坐诊灵芝文化体验中心，结合灵芝药用特点，以内服外治的睡眠障碍综合疗法精准解决睡眠问题，激活睡眠与银发经济。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-box-open" style="color: var(--primary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">好产品</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">打通“从药用干预到日常滋养”的转化链路。下沉研发医疗级院内制剂，同时以“352工程”三标准五规范赋能大众消费品，提供包含破壁灵芝孢子粉、参灵枣仁膏在内的全生命周期健康方案。</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 三特色板块 -->
                <h3 class="serif" style="font-size: 28px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--primary);"><span style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: 8px;">三特色 · 核心壁垒</span></h3>
                <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px;">
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-seedling" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">仿野生椴木种植</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">选用经脱毒提纯选育的纯正川芝菌种，坚守品质底线，拒绝廉价袋料种植。全面推行仿野生椴木种植法，并在种植环节全套落地 352 认证标准，确保天然与高效成分。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-bed" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">睡眠康养健康疗愈</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">将睡眠调理打造成核心 IP。从助眠主题客房、静心步道环境，到口服孢子粉、参灵枣仁膏等睡眠滋补方案，及针灸推拿等中医服务，单向打透“睡眠障碍”痛点。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="text-align: left; padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-compass" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                        <h3 class="serif" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;">一二三产融合沉浸体验</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">彻底打破产学研与文旅边界，融合“灵芝种植基地（一产） + 产品研发加工（二产） + 登山游学与体验中心（三产文旅） + 中医诊疗（康养）”，形成无缝体验闭环。</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TCM Hospital Preparations -->
