                        <span class="pill-badge" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">川药制备字Z20210006000</span>
                        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 10px;">古方化裁，针对肺热咳嗽、咽干痰多、气喘等呼吸系统症状进行深度调理与化解。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card glass-card" style="padding: 40px 25px; border-radius: 24px; text-align: center; background: rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(166, 124, 82, 0.15);">
                        <i class="fas fa-notes-medical" style="font-size: 38px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 20px;"></i>
